# tools/golden_gen/extract.ps1
# Mechanically extracts VERBATIM functions/tables/macros from the vendored
# SVT-AV1 tree (third_party/SVT-AV1) into svt_gen.c. Never edits extracted
# text except the ONE documented substitution noted below. Fails loudly if
# any required symbol cannot be located.
#
# Usage:  powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./extract.ps1   (from this directory)
# Output: svt_gen.c  (gitignored? NO - committed output is regenerated by
#         running this script; see README.md)

